rom'\nScholar Kintorom says 'Now that we know the answers are in the Encyclopedia Norrathica, we must travel to the top of the library to [confront] the Head Librarian on its whereabouts. Otherwise you could [interview] scholars about my research, [locate] more books, or help me fulfill my [dream].'\nYou say, 'Confront?'\nScholar Kintorom says 'I have no doubt they will try to stop us but I'm no good in a fight. I'll need you and your friends to clear the way to the head librarian. Be prepared for anything. Shall we [proceed]?\nYou have been assigned the task 'The Stuff of Dreams'.\nScholar Kintorom has discovered the existence of the Encyclopedia Norrathica, a book which contains all the information regarding the creation of Norrath and the Gods. He wants to confront the head librarian and claim the book for himself, so he can fulfill his dreams, but needs your help to clear the way to the top of the library.\n_Say \"proceed\" to zone in._\n\n---\n\n**General Information**\n_In this instance, you can expect trash mob types to hit for a max ~6,200. Nameds hit for a little more (but no flurry, no rampage, and no enrage). They may not even summon (this is not confirmed). Some nameds have an AE associated with them (if so, they are listed below)._\n_Trash mobs are rootable/snareable, stunnable, and mezzable (even with 81-85 Enchanter mezzes)._\n_The \"Make your way...\" steps (which are update locations found gradually further into the library) open up one at a time as you kill the mobs associated with them._\n_After triggering one of these steps, the trash mobs begin spawning one at a time. The named is permanently rooted, so its attacks are avoidable until you want to engage it. (There is an achievement for killing the named before the trash.)_\n_NOTE: Make sure to engage the named within a minute of killing the last add spawn. If you let too much time pass without doing so, another wave of adds spawns._\n\n---\n\nMake your way toward the top of the library 0/1 (The 