1 (The Library)\nKill 3 a nightmare 0/3 (The Library)\n_Note: The nightmares proc on their targets \"Shadow Touch\":_\nShadow Touch: Single Target, Magic (-700)\n1: Decrease Hitpoints by 1500 per tick _(3 ticks)_\nKill 1 Compendium of Nightmares 0/1 (The Library)\nCompendium of Nightmares summons forth a nightmare from its pages.\n_It casts \"Waking Nightmares\":_\nWaking Nightmares: Single Target, Magic (0)\n1: Increase Spell Haste by 10%\n2: Inhibit Melee Attacks by (15%)\n3: Ultravision\nCompendium of Nightmares has been slain by \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_!\nCompendium of Nightmares's corpse falls into a heap of dust and torn pages.\n\n---\n\nMake your way toward the top of the library 0/1 (The Library)\nKill 15 a musty tome 0/15 (The Library)\n_Note: The musty tomes come in waves of 3-5 at a time. They hit for a max ~1,300 each and are crowd-controllable._\nKill 1 Archivist Herrdar 0/1 (The Library)\n_He's found up the stairs on the next level. He casts \"Dust of the Ages:\"_\nDust of the Ages: Targeted AE 50', Chromatic (-650)\n1: Decrease Hitpoints by 8000 per tick\n2: Unknown #408 (100/80/0)\nArchivist Herrdar has been slain by \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_!\nArchivist Herrdar's corpse cries out in pain, before falling eternally still.\n\n---\n\nMake your way toward the top of the library 0/1 (The Library)\n_The Head Librarian attacks once you trigger this update._\nKill 1 Head Librarian Matilda 0/1 (The Library)\nHead Librarian Matilda raises her voice in warning, 'Those who make noise will be silenced by my hand!'\n_Matilda hits for a max ~7,000 and AEs \"Forceful Knowledge\":_\nForceful Knowledge: PB AE 50', Magic (-700)\n1: Decrease Hitpoints by 22000\n2: Decrease Mana by 3000\n3: Decrease Endurance by 2700\n_She also spawns time-based adds one at a time. They're called \"a dutiful librarian\" and will keep spawning until six of them are up. If you kill one, another will take its place. You'll want to kill the Head Librarian while offtanking or mezzing or rooting the adds._\nHead Librarian Matilda has been slain by \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_!\nHead Librarian Matilda falls over in defeat.\n\n---\n\nAllow Scholar Kintorom to claim the Encyclopedia Norrathica 0/1 (The Library)\n_After the Head Librarian and her adds are dead, approach the Encyclopedia Norrathica. Scholar Kintorom appears and has this exchange..._\nScholar Kintorom says 'Finally I've found it! All the answers I seek will surely be in the Encyclopedia Norrathica. You are mine now! Wait, what's happening? This isn't right! I was so close to fulfilling my dreams! Noooooo.....'\n_The Head Librarian then respawns (non-KOS):_\nHead Librarian Matilda says 'Because the knowledge contained in this book is forbidden, Kintorom was banished from this place. He will never be permitted to return. Some things are better left in your dreams, adventurers. Take these things and ruminate on what you have witnessed this day. Inform me when you are ready to [leave].'\nYou helped Scholar Kintorom reach the Encyclopedia Norrathica, though things didn't turn out as expected.\nClaim your reward from the ornate chest 0/1 (The Library)\n\n---\n\n_Task rewards:_\nExperience (about 3% regular exp at Level 86)\n315 platinum\n20 Dream Motes\nFaction with Dream Delvers\n_Known chest rewards (1 item + 1 spell per task):_\nBattlemage's Aegis\nGlumb's Trinket of Tactical Cowardice\nGolden Triumphal Cindercape\nHandful of the Patch Guardian's Straw\nPhantasmic Morningstar\nSap of Rejuvenation\nSlime Coated Pebble of the Deep\nThulian Linked Wristguard\nTreantwood Longbow\nWaspwing Cleaver\nMinor Nebulous Dream Fragment\nLesser Nebulous Dream Fragment\nMedian Nebulous Dream Fragment\nGreater Nebulous Dream Fragment\nGlowing Nebulous Dream Fragment\n- Dream Mote [item=90255]",
