g me? I will make sure you are rewarded, of course.'\n_A task window pops up with five options to choose from._\nYou have been assigned the task 'Research Assistant'.\nThe now-helpless necromancer Varesa K`Zen cannot get past the library custodians and armored watchers to do spell research. She has asked you to put a stop to their aggression.\n\n---\n\nDefeat the library custodians 0/4 (The Library)\nDefeat the armored watchers 0/3 (The Library)\nSpeak to Varesa K`Zen 0/1 (The Library)\nYou say, 'Hail, Varesa K`Zen'\nYou've put down the library custodians and armored watchers for Varesa K'Zen, allowing her and others further access to the library.\n_Rewards:_\nExperience\nMinor Faction with Dream Delvers",
