So, are you interested in assisting me? I will make sure you are rewarded, of course.'\n_A task window pops up with five options to choose from._\nYou have been assigned the task 'Bibliophiles'.\nVaresa K`Zen, a once-powerful necromancer, is unsure of the true nature of the librarians and their assistants. She does want them dealt with, though, as they hoard all the knowledge that she requires to gain her magical abilities back.\n\n---\n\nDefeat the listless librarians 0/5 (The Library)\nDefeat the librarians` weary assistants 0/4 (The Library)\nSpeak to Varesa K`Zen 0/1 (The Library)\nYou say, 'Hail, Varesa K`Zen'\nYour task 'Bibliophiles' has been updated.\nYou've stopped the hostile librarians and their assistants making it safe to study in the strange library.\n_Rewards:_\nExperience\nMinor Faction with Dream Delvers",
